oice C is incorrect because the finite present progressive tense verb &ldquo;is telling&rdquo; can&rsquo;t be used in this way to explain the reason that Engle uses poetry in her novel.&nbsp;</p>","parenttemplatename":"OSP-701-SEC","parenttemplateid":"","templateclusterid":"8c8ffa78-d41a-44eb-a6bf-96f02afe9978","templateclustername":"","origin":"proteus","position":"0","createDate":1691007959347,"updateDate":1691007959347}$SATQ$::jsonb, 1691007959347, 1691007959347),
    ($SATQ$e3c1b4f7$SATQ$, $SATQ$3278d8b3-d2c0-42fb-a33c-0dc1c901b044$SATQ$::uuid, NULL, NULL, $SATQ$qbank$SATQ$, $SATQ$SAT$SATQ$, 1, $SATQ$Reading and Writing$SATQ$, $SATQ$Standard English Conventions$SATQ$, $SATQ$SEC$SATQ$, $SATQ$BOU$SATQ$, $SATQ$Boundaries$SATQ$, $SATQ$H$SATQ$, 7, $SATQ$mcq$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>Digital artist Jung (Lulu) Chen primarily uses a suite of software tools to create illustrations for children&rsquo;s books. To manifest the warm and welcoming atmospheres that are a signature of her <span aria-hidden="true">______</span><span class="sr-only">blank</span> she occasionally relies on more traditional art techniques, such as painting with watercolors.</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$<p>Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?</p>$SATQ$, $SATQ$[{"id":"e4d39361-a516-4528-9006-c518cdd0254c","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> though<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span></p>"},{"id":"0ada847d-466f-4570-aba8-009e5e70a253","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> though</p>"},{"id":"61e23fac-2fda-4aa1-b3d7-c691fe15422f","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">;</span> though<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span></p>"},{"id":"42dfed41-6a9b-4aa6-b1f4-63868111cee0","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> though<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">;</span></p>"}]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["A"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$["e4d39361-a516-4528-9006-c518cdd0254c"]$SATQ$::jsonb, $SATQ$<p>Choice A is the best answer. The convention being tested is the use of punctuation within a sentence. The comma after "work" pairs with the comma after "though" to separate the supplementary element "though" from the rest of the sentence. This supplementary element signals that what follows is an exception to Chen using software tools to create illustrations, and the pair of commas indicates that this element could be removed without affecting the grammatical coherence of the sentence.</p><p>Choice B is incorrect because the comma after "work" must be paired with a comma after "though" to separate the supplementary element from the rest of the sentence. Choice C is incorrect because a semicolon can&rsquo;t be paired with a comma in this way to separate the supplementary element from the rest of the sentence. Choice D is incorrect because a semicolon can&rsquo;t be paired with a comma in this way to separate the supplementary element from the rest of the sentence.</p>$SATQ$, false, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $SATQ${"questionId":"e3c1b4f7","external_id":"3278d8b3-d2c0-42fb-a33c-0dc1c901b044","vaultid":null,"uId":"92bc8b14-e579-4b49-b61f-c180815d0bb7","program":"SAT","test_type":1,"test_type_desc":"Reading and Writing","primary_class_cd":"SEC","domain":"Standard English Conventions","skill_cd":"BOU","skill_desc":"Boundaries","difficulty":"H","score_band_range_cd":7,"type":"mcq","stimulus":"<p>Digital artist Jung (Lulu) Chen primarily uses a suite of software tools to create illustrations for children&rsquo;s books. To manifest the warm and welcoming atmospheres that are a signature of her <span aria-hidden=\"true\">______</span><span class=\"sr-only\">blank</span> she occasionally relies on more traditional art techniques, such as painting with watercolors.</p>","stem":"<p>Which choice completes the text so that it conforms to the conventions of Standard English?</p>","answerOptions":[{"id":"e4d39361-a516-4528-9006-c518cdd0254c","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> though<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span></p>"},{"id":"0ada847d-466f-4570-aba8-009e5e70a253","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span> though</p>"},{"id":"61e23fac-2fda-4aa1-b3d7-c691fe15422f","content":"<p>work<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">;</span> though<span data-ssml-say-as=\"characters\">,</span></p>"},{"id":"42dfed41-6a9b-4aa6-b1f4-63868111cee0","cont